    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1128">

                <pb facs="1155" n="1145" xml:id="pg1145"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/10–749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary to the Consul General at
                        Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McConaughy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-10-07T15:00:00-05:00">October 7, 1949—3
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2051. Urtels 4211, 4217, October 7. Urgently request all facts concerning release
                    Isbrandtsen vessels and what conditions if any were imposed by Chi Gov. Does <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Flying Trader</hi> contemplate loading cargo and
                    passengers outbound passage Shanghai?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
